  "details": "Custom layers set to Interact Passthrough in the VRC Scene Descriptor still block pickups raycasts in the client sim.\n\nBuilding and running a test in the actual VRChat client seems to be working just fine-- I can click on pickups through colliders on layers set in \"interact passthrough\".\n\nSeems to just be a client sim issue.\n\nThis bug makes it harder to test a world I'm working on in client sim- for example, I have some colliders that block players from clipping into storage container geometry, but in client sim I can't pickup up items inside these shelves/containers.",
